  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Peacebuilding in Conflict-Affected Mindanao - Philippines</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Australia&apos;s Peacebuilding in Conflict-Affected Mindanao investment contributes to peace and stability in the Philippines, reducing the threat of terrorism and violent extremism. It responds to our commitment to support the ongoing peace process between the Government of the Philippines and the Moro Islamic Liberation Front (MILF). Our assistance includes supporting the establishment of the Bangsamoro Autonomous Region in Muslim Mindanao (BARMM), and working towards long-term development in the region&apos;s conflict-affected areas with our implementing partners, including multilateral and non-government organisations, national and sub-national government.</narrative>
  </description>
